4) WeeLLM =E2=80=94 WATCH / TEST ON CHEAP GPU
GitHub discovery: https://github.com/topics/longcat
Updated Sep 17, 2026. Streams diffusion transformer/text-encoder
layers through limited VRAM and claims support for large diffusion
models with as little as 4 GB VRAM without quantization, including
LTX-family models. If robust for video-adjacent diffusion workloads,
this is directly relevant to collapsing our minimum GPU requirement.
Experiment: run an LTX-supported workload on the smallest rentable GPU
and compare wall-clock $/clip against quantized conventional
inference.
Maturity: RUNNABLE/EXPERIMENTAL.

