BIGGEST CAPABILITY JUMP
Not a new foundation renderer this hour. The useful change is OSS
integration quality: persistent-character runtimes and self-hosted
realtime avatar stacks are becoming composable enough that we should
stop building orchestration from scratch.

CHEAPEST PRACTICAL WIN
Reuse a prerecorded/realtime avatar performance layer with
MuseTalk/LatentSync rather than regenerating full diffusion video for
every spoken segment. Reserve expensive video generation for hooks,
transitions and B-roll.

WATCH NEXT
moeru-ai / Airi; MuseTalk integration ecosystem; low-VRAM diffusion
inference projects such as WeeLLM.

STACK DELTA
Add an explicit Character Runtime above the media models: persona +
memory + current state + audience model + acting policy. Keep voice,
